  "text_to_speech": "[Music] [Applause] hello I'm Dr Steven Steiner we're here in the dry Arizona desert demonstrating the water repelling properties of hydrophobic silica aerogel I'm going to coat my hands with lumira aerogel particles made by cavid and this will put a hydrophobic coating over my hands so that when I place them in the water they come out place my hands under the water you can see the reflection looks quite strange and if I put water on my hands it beads off and this property is called hydrophobicity it's introduced by changing the hydroxy groups on the backbone of the silica aerogel for trimethyl Silo groups which are very non-polar and repel ael.com [Music] done",
